# Footer "Subscribe" form — /api/subscribe forwards the visitor's address to our inbox.
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in ONE of the two providers. With neither set the form
# still works end to end, it just logs the address to the server console instead of mailing it.

# --- Option A (simplest): web3forms.com ------------------------------------------------------
# Enter the destination address (hello@usectl.com) at https://web3forms.com — the access key
# arrives by email. No account, no domain verification; submissions are forwarded to that address.
WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# --- Option B: resend.com --------------------------------------------------------------------
# A real transactional send. SUBSCRIBE_FROM must be on a domain verified in Resend; the default
# onboarding@resend.dev only delivers to the Resend account's own address.
RESEND_API_KEY=
SUBSCRIBE_TO=hello@usectl.com
SUBSCRIBE_FROM=onboarding@resend.dev
